 process=[("What it must know","Services, prices, hours, the ten questions you answer every week, and what it must never promise."),("Voice","How it greets people, how formal it is, and what it says when it does not know."),("Calendar and channels","Phone, web chat, SMS and email connected to the booking system you already use."),("Escalation","Which situations go to a person immediately, and to whom."),("Two weeks supervised","Every conversation reviewed by us and by you, and the answers corrected."),("Handover","Transcripts, monthly summary, and a way to change any answer yourself.")],
 delivers=["A receptionist answering phone, chat, SMS and email around the clock","Booking written directly into your calendar","Escalation rules with named owners","Full transcript of every conversation, kept under your control","Monthly summary: calls taken, bookings made, questions it could not answer","Two weeks of supervised operation before it runs on its own"],
